# Keeps the Docker build context lean and prevents host-built artifacts
# (e.g. a macOS/Linux-specific compiled pty.node under node_modules) from
# ever reaching a COPY into the image. See src/webui/api and (from Phase 4)
# src/webui/web, which the Dockerfile COPYs into the build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS and local tooling/agent state — never needed inside the image.
.git
.github
.beacon
.beacon-delegate
.claude

# Secrets written by the setup wizard on the host; never send to the daemon.
.env
.secret
*.pem
devcontainer_ed25519*
.sudopass
